          <article><h3>Airport transfer</h3><p>A late flight leaving a Mountain city may put the Eastern pickup after midnight. The driver needs the arrival city date, not only the departure city time.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Cloud release freeze</h3><p>A maintenance window that starts after dinner in Mountain Time can land near midnight for Eastern stakeholders. The ticket should carry local time and UTC.</p></article>
